            <div xml:id="d1196">

                <pb facs="1024" n="920" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg920"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.93/45.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chinese Chargé d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of China</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-09-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 23, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: I beg to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your note of September 19th informing me [etc.] the substance of
                    which I telegraphed to my Government for its information, and in reply thereto I
                    have been directed to ask the Department to instruct the <pb facs="1025" n="921"
                        xml:id="pg921"/> American Consul at Durango to render such assistance as may
                    be necessary to those Chinese who are destitute and needing help, and that the
                    Legation will be glad to reimburse the Department for such expense as may be
                    incurred.</p>
                <p>I beg [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chang Kang-jen</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Note</hi>.—The Consul was instructed as above
                        requested, on September 26.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
